  "suggested_rules": [
    "Strong phrase match in threats, self-harm encouragement, blackmail, or scams should be high priority.",
    "One weak token alone should not be enough to flag unless the category is very sensitive and context is risky.",
    "If 2 to 3 risky tokens appear together and no safe marker is present, mark as medium risk.",
    "If safe conversation markers or negation context markers are present, lower the risk or send for human review instead of auto-blocking.",
    "For self-harm distress from the speaker, treat as support/escalation, not punishment.",
    "Keep adding real user examples to improve coverage over time."
  ]
